### FILE PATH: C:/Users/ashay/Downloads/Quiz/QR-Code-Generator\style.css

**Error:**
1.  **Requirement Violation:** The user requested the body background color to be green.
2.  **Invalid CSS Value:** `#imgBox { width: 100; }` is missing units (e.g., `px` or `%`). Browsers will ignore this property.
3.  **UI Improvement:** The `invalid-input` class is applied to a `<p>` tag but has properties like `border` and `background-color` that might clash with the layout if not managed.

**Fixed code:**
```css
*{
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family :'Poppins', sans-serif;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body{
    /* Requirement: Make body color green */
    background-color: #28a745;
}

.container{
    width : 400px;
    background-color: white;
    border-radius: 10px;  

    /* Centering the div */
    padding: 25px 35px;
    position:absolute;
    top : 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);  
}

.container p{
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.container input{
    width: 100%;
    height: 50px;
    border: 1px solid #494eea;
    outline: 0;
    padding: 10px;
    margin: 10px 0 20px;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

.container button{
    width: 100%;
    height: 50px;
    border : 0;
    background-color: #494eea;
    color: white;
    outline: 0;
    border-radius: 5px;
    margin:20px 0;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
}

#imgBox{
    /* Fixed: Added % unit */
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 10px;
}

#Qr-Image {
    max-width: 150px;
}

.invalid-input{
    border: 2px solid red;
    background-color: rgb(232, 132, 132);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 3px;
    padding: 5px;
    text-align: center;
}
```

